| What | Where |
|-----|-----|
| Express app factory | `apps/api/src/server.ts` |
| nvm shell wrapper | `apps/api/src/nvm/nvm.service.ts` |
| Output parser | `apps/api/src/nvm/nvm.parser.ts` |
| Types + validation | `apps/api/src/nvm/nvm.types.ts` |
| API routes | `apps/api/src/routes/nvm.routes.ts` |
| Angular root | `apps/web/src/app/app.ts` |
| HTTP service | `apps/web/src/app/services/nvm-api.service.ts` |
| Frontend types | `apps/web/src/app/models/nvm.models.ts` |
